{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01J3moqwqvedD39dmrXiFxZ6","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_7/projects/gen-depth-contamination/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-16\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\\\n| exp_021_length_ablation | 文本长度消融：128/256/512 tokens 下 K* 是否稳定？验证 K*=2 不依赖于 256-token 固定长度设定。Qwen2.5-1.5B (base) continuation, C4 5K, depth 0-5。 | — | — | — |\\\\n| exp_018_llama8b_depth | Cross-family K* 验证：LLaMA-3.1-8B continuation mode 的 K* 是否 = 2？首次超出 Qwen 家族，验证 K* universality 跨模型架构。C4 5K, depth 0-5, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B base。 | — | — | — |\\\\n| exp_019_mistral7b_depth | Cross-family K* 验证：Mistral-7B-v0.3 continuation mode 的 K* 是否 = 2？第二个非 Qwen 家族模型。C4 5K, depth 0-5, scorer=Mistral-7B-v0.3 (self-scorer)。与 exp-001/002/017 self-scoring 方法一致，exp_A_alt_scorer 已证明 scorer 不影响 K*。 | — | — | — |\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- exp_022_cross_scorer_matrix: 完整 4×4 cross-scorer 矩阵：4 generator (Qwen-rw/Qwen-cont/Pythia/OLMo) × 4 scorer (Qwen-Instruct/Qwen-base/Pythia/OLMo) 的 K* 和 pairwise AUC，量化 self-scoring advantage 并验证 scorer 独立性。（排队等待 GPU）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **exp_016_base_vs_instruct** (success): Base vs Instruct K* 对比：Qwen2.5-1.5B (base) continuation mode 的 K* 是否与 exp-017 (Instruct continuation, K*=2) 一致？封堵 \\\\\\\"K*=2 是 instruct-tuning 副产物\\\\\\\" 攻击面。唯一变量 = base vs instruct。 ← 基于 exp_017_qwen_continuation\\\\n  [exp016_bootstrap_ci](/api/workspace-files/projects/gen-depth-contamination/artifacts/exp_016_base_vs_instruct/data/exp016_bootstrap_ci.json)\\\\n- **exp_003_decoding_ablation** (success): 解码策略调控 K*：不同 top_p/temperature 设置是否改变饱和边界（greedy→更低 K*? 高温度→更高 K*?）\\\\n  [exp003_config12_analysis](/api/workspace-files/projects/gen-depth-contamination/artifacts/exp_003_decoding_ablation/report/exp003_analysis_report.md) | [exp003_decoding_ablation_figure](/api/workspace-files/projects/gen-depth-contamination/artifacts/exp_003_decoding_ablation/chart/exp003_figure_info.md) | [exp003_bootstrap_ci](westc-26893:/root/autodl-tmp/gen-depth-contamination/artifacts/exp003_bootstrap_ci.json)\\\\n- **exp_012_binary_confidence** (success): Binary detector confidence (DivEye log-PPL + Binoculars ratio) 与 true depth 的 Spearman correlation，验证 binary confidence ≠ depth。Binoculars: observer=Pythia-1.4b, performer=OLMo-1B-0724-hf。\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 21 / 负向 0 / 失败 0 / 共 21\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\ncqa1-22115: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1, cuda:2, cuda:3\\\\nwestc-26893: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2282, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_011hczS8y11tp9WcB3gzu3YP","session_id":"f435afbf-9516-4ae9-a254-af07d6e2235e","uuid":"d202c308-a041-4d3f-a8ca-2b1652aca2f9","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:17:15.752Z"}
